nv-memory-size: NV_MEMORY_SIZE = 16384

Classification: profile setting.

The TCG reference default (as mstpm20) instead of IBM's 32768, which
determines how many NV indices and persistent objects fit (TPM_RC_NV_SPACE)
and the reported NV capacity.

diff --git a/src/TpmProfile_Misc.h b/src/TpmProfile_Misc.h
--- a/src/TpmProfile_Misc.h
+++ b/src/TpmProfile_Misc.h
@@ -90,7 +90,8 @@
 #define MAX_NV_INDEX_SIZE          2048
 #define MAX_NV_BUFFER_SIZE         1024
 #define MAX_CAP_BUFFER             1024
-#define NV_MEMORY_SIZE             32768 /* kgold */
+// tpm-rs differential testing: the TCG reference default (as mstpm20).
+#define NV_MEMORY_SIZE             16384
 #define MIN_COUNTER_INDICES        8
 #define NUM_STATIC_PCR             16
 #define MAX_ALG_LIST_SIZE          64
